Point of info: more pets is not always a good thing. In fact you may 
want to keep some cats/dogs alive and non-tame on the upper levels just 
in case your current one dies; you'll go through them at a slower rate 
in that case.

If you really want to do the "You And What Army?" thing, my suggestion 
is to poly into a female gray dragon and lay lots of eggs... be sure 
your current pet doesn't eat them though. This could potentially give 
you "compensation" when your pets die (if you've kept them alive long 
enough) :)

